90624577b0a01c","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-16T21:41:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T21:41:14Z"},{"id":648705453,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4mqnWt","name":"stable-win-x64-Gloomberb.tar.zst","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":313063194,"digest":"sha256:e42430f7c61fa2bc4ec567b1982051d0a2955320b86ebef5414c8d1751943e55","download_count":4,"created_at":"2026-10-16T21:41:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T21:41:14Z"},{"id":648705456,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4mqnWw","name":"stable-win-x64-GloomberbSetup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdos-program","state":"uploaded","size":290457562,"digest":"sha256:7b61100675e4c3af81c3669bfa5e7fefca909302b34cc560a9efa4289f0547bb","download_count":44,"created_at":"2026-10-16T21:41:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T21:41:14Z"},{"id":648705463,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4mqnW3","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":72,"digest":"sha256:06fb277c4a2bb3244a430bc44f8e4530f72f012ab889ac688bac3718a3266119","download_count":12,"created_at":"2026-10-16T21:41:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T21:41:01Z"}],"body":"## Highlights\n\n- **Nightly desktop updates install again.** The top bar no longer sticks at \"Already on the latest version\" on nightly; switch to stable once to install this update. (#1890)\n- **Insider buying across the market.** `INS` with no ticker ranks the companies whose insiders buy in the open market: clusters, repeat buyers and outsized buys. (#1848)\n- **Broker positions stay complete.** Cloud sync no longer drops broker positions; update every device, then sign in to your broker again. (#1874)\n- **One crosshair per tab.** Hovering a chart moves the crosshair on every chart in the same layout tab. (#1879, #1884)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- `EVTS`, `ERN` and `EE` show same-day earnings actuals with the move so far, and `PF` tints `LAST` by each row's move since you last looked. (#1891, #1877)\n- Charts: values sit on their axis, picking the selected range again undoes a pan, `HP` opens on daily bars with a running period marked, and `G` charts crack spreads. (#1863, #1851, #1889, #1870, #1852)\n- Options: `GEX` exports add up with walls by expiry, `OSA` prices a collar, and open interest shows its age. (#1888, #1880, #1887)\n- A moved symbol shows where its company went instead of another security's data. (#1858, #1854)\n- `quote`, `history` and the other CLI market commands give a signed-in Pro account real-time quotes, like `fn`. (#1893)\n- Chat: long channels stay quick and DMs sort by newest message. (#1857, #1867, #1872)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.17.5...v0.17.6)\n"}
